        {
          "text": "Ye tun ing’eto Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ bororiosiek eng’ taing’ung’, eng’ ole iwendi iname ak kobunjin choto, ak imeny emenywa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
