              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameyachi ko u noto Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’: amu kiy age tugul ne wegot eng’ Jehovah, ne wechei inendet, ko kiyachi ko u noto ichek kanamonikwak; amu beelei agot werikwak ak tibikwak kobeeljin kanamonikwak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
